        <div class="col-centre">
            
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-xs-24">
                    <div class="text-with-leading-icon">
                        <span class="icon-scale-footer"></span>
                        <p class="h3">“We promote a truly level playing field, where participants can trade in a fair, effective and transparent environment and where all firms are treated equally and abide by the same rules.”</p>                        
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-xs-24">
                    <article class="content add-inline-icon">
                        <p>ParFX is open on an equal basis to all participants with access to CLS settlement services, delivering a fair trading environment and equal access to trading opportunities for everyone.</p>
<p>The meaningful randomisation applied to all order submissions, amendments and cancellations is designed to encourage a level playing field for participants whatever their technological or financial strength.</p>
<p>Trading costs are equally applied to all participants and democratically incorporated into actual transaction. Market data is distributed – at cost and in parallel – to all active participants.</p>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-right">
            
	<div class="margin-t-40px-xs margin-b-40px-xs">
	    
        	<div class="add-bottom-border-blue h3">Contact us</div>
        	<p><p>To discuss how ParFX<br>can support your trading<br>needs, please e-mail<br><a href="mailto:sales@parfx.com">sales@parfx.com</a> or call<br> +44 (0)20 7198 1575. </p></p>
    	
    </div>

